@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@zoneId = 1
@alertId = 1

### List venues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues

### List zones for venue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues/1/zones

### Ingest a low-risk event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/risk-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zoneId": {{zoneId}},
  "timestamp": "2026-08-07T12:00:00Z",
  "densityScore": 2.8,
  "peopleCount": 28,
  "movementSpeed": 1.25,
  "riskLevel": "LOW",
  "explanation": "Density stable and movement flow remains normal",
  "sourceClipId": "india-gate-demo-01"
}

### Ingest a high-risk event (creates an alert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/risk-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zoneId": {{zoneId}},
  "timestamp": "2026-08-07T12:00:05Z",
  "densityScore": 4.2,
  "peopleCount": 42,
  "movementSpeed": 0.55,
  "riskLevel": "HIGH",
  "explanation": "Density crossed 4.2/m² with 30% speed drop",
  "sourceClipId": "india-gate-demo-01"
}

### Recent zone events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/{{zoneId}}/risk-events?limit=50

### Active alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?active=true

### Resolve an alert
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve
